      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是她时时常保在心的信念。\n胜负、赌注、迈向胜利之路的刺激感。\n那股让她孤注一掷地丢出骰子的热意──",
      "source_fingerprint": "67aac8c453848c067ee9fc55eadd35faf7315a5aed0d1dcbbb0905a8309ca92d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049515.json",
      "json_path": [
